            "old_status": "major_outage"
          }
        ],
        "body": "We are continuing to work on an issue affecting GitHub Actions. Webhook triggers remain throttled to aid recovery, so many push and pull request events are not triggering new workflow runs.<br /><br />We identified runners being assigned jobs that are no longer valid and are deploying a change to address this issue. Both GitHub-hosted and self-hosted runners are affected.<br /><br />Copilot code review, Copilot coding agent, and GitHub Pages may experience failures or delays. Migrations using GitHub Enterprise Importer have been paused to support mitigation efforts.",
        "created_at": "2026-08-06T21:30:42.677Z",
        "custom_tweet": null,
